{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfrzW5yegrojmY4zCAgV1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`find_all_matching_from_provider()` now takes `age_fallback: AgeFallback` instead of the boolean, and pinned packages skip age filtering. Both test files pass (61 tests). I couldn't run `ruff`, since it isn't installed in `.venv`, so formatting and linting are unchecked. I didn't run mypy or the rest of the test suite.\n\n- **Fallback enum:** `AgeFallback` (`ALL`, `NEWEST`, `NONE`) is exported from `fromager.resolver`. The three fallback log messages use the exact text you gave. `NEWEST` keeps the first candidate, since the provider returns them highest version first.\n- **Pin skip:** a new helper, `_is_pinned()`, checks that the provider's constraint for `req.name` is a single `==` specifier. When it is, age filtering is skipped and the INFO \"skipping age filter for pinned constraint\" message is logged. Range constraints (`>=`, `<`, `!=`) are still age-filtered.\n- **Bootstrap caller:** `bootstrap_requirement_resolver.py` passes `AgeFallback.NEWEST` in multi-version mode and `AgeFallback.ALL` otherwise.\n- **Tests:**\n  - **In `tests/test_cooldown.py`:** I added tests for the `NEWEST` fallback, a pin older than the window, and a range constraint still being filtered. I also updated the existing `NONE` test to the new parameter.\n  - **In `tests/test_bootstrap_requirement_resolver.py`:** I added a parametrized test that the right `age_fallback` is passed in each mode.\n\nI didn't update the docs.\n\nA wildcard `==` such as `==1.*` is counted as a pin, because `_is_pinned()` only checks the operator, as your spec words it. That's a one-line change if you'd rather treat wildcards as ranges."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1613,"cache_read_input_tokens":78833,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1613},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69f335a0-4ee8-43b5-b034-6ee281abb7af","uuid":"1948db8f-f644-48ee-8e66-99952c34ddd6","timestamp":"2026-10-09T16:38:40.011Z","request_id":"req_011CfrzW5h2bRKYfevpxv6xv"}
